candidates.expected_effect:
These are estimates; the GPU cost per frame is unmeasured. SCK work falls to the refresh multiple at or above the pace:
- 120 Hz viewer of a 120 Hz Mac at Balanced (Mac to Mac MacBook Pros): 120 → 60 frames composed per second;
- Quality preset on a 60 Hz Mac: 60 → 30;
- congestion pace 20 on 60 Hz: 60 → 20;
