candidates.expected_effect:
Estimates from the measured per-call costs:
- a verify costs about 60 µs today and almost nothing when its answer is reused;
- at 60 fps, view-only: about 244 verifies a second (14.6 ms of CPU per second on thread C, about 1.5% of a core), plus 250 more a second while the pointer moves (another 15 ms per second);
