   - a pipelined Fake with 45 ms latency at pace 120 (full at depth 4) is capped, then lifted within 2 s, and does not ratchet;
   - a Fake whose encoder_full is true triggers it with pending < 4;
   - the cap rises back when the serial Fake speeds up.

